/*!
\page page_sttriggerid StTriggerId

\brief Container for STAR trigger IDs that fired; stores up to 64 IDs with version information.

\section sttriggerid_overview Overview
\c StTriggerId holds the set of trigger IDs that fired for an event, together with
name, threshold, and prescale version numbers that uniquely identify the trigger
configuration.  A 64-bit bitmask enables fast membership tests.  It is normally
accessed via \ref page_sttriggeridcollection which provides nominal, prescaled, and
sampled variants.

\section sttriggerid_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
TObject
 └── StObject
      └── StTriggerId
\endcode

\section sttriggerid_members Data Members

| Type | Name | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| ULong64_t | mMask | 64-bit bitmask of fired trigger IDs |
| UInt_t[64] | mId | Trigger ID for each stored entry |
| UInt_t[64] | mVersion | Combined version per entry |
| UInt_t[64] | mNameVersion | Name version per entry |
| UInt_t[64] | mThresholdVersion | Threshold version per entry |
| UInt_t[64] | mPrescaleVersion | Prescale version per entry |

\section sttriggerid_methods Key Methods

| Signature | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| `ULong64_t mask() const` | 64-bit fired-trigger bitmask |
| `bool isTrigger(unsigned int id) const` | True if trigger id fired |
| `std::vector<unsigned int> triggerIds() const` | All fired trigger IDs |
| `unsigned int triggerId(int idx) const` | Trigger ID at index idx |
| `unsigned int nameVersion(unsigned int id) const` | Name version for trigger id |
| `unsigned int thresholdVersion(unsigned int id) const` | Threshold version |
| `unsigned int prescaleVersion(unsigned int id) const` | Prescale version |
| `void addTrigger(unsigned int id, ...)` | Add a fired trigger |
| `void setMask(ULong64_t)` | Set the bitmask |

\section sttriggerid_usage Usage Example
\code{.cpp}
StTriggerId* trig = event->triggerIdCollection()->nominal();
if (trig->isTrigger(15007))
    cout << "MinBias fired!" << endl;
std::vector<unsigned int> ids = trig->triggerIds();
\endcode

\see \ref page_stl0trigger
\see \ref page_sttrigger
*/
